This repository depends on, and does not copy, the Lean library NavierStokesAndEuler
(OpenAI, Apache License 2.0), which formalizes "Finite time blowup for Navier–Stokes" and
"Finite time blowup for the Euler equation" by OpenAI (2026). The reference definitions it uses
were adapted by OpenAI from the Formal Conjectures project of Google DeepMind
(FormalConjectures/Millenium/NavierStokes.lean, Apache License 2.0).
